请点击下面链接确认加入：%4$s','Sorry, you are not allowed to create users.'=>'抱歉，您不能新建用户。','Sorry, you are not allowed to add users to this network.'=>'抱歉，您不能添加用户到此网络。','Update User'=>'更新用户','Update Profile'=>'更新个人资料','Denied: %s'=>'拒绝：%s','Capabilities'=>'机能','Additional Capabilities'=>'额外权限','Log %s out of all locations.'=>'已在所有位置登出%1$s。','Log Out Everywhere'=>'登出所有设备','Did you lose your phone or leave your account logged in at a public computer? You can log out everywhere else, and stay logged in here.'=>'您丢失了您的手机或是在公共电脑上登录着您的账户？您可以在其他设备上登出，只在此处保留登录状态。','You are only logged in at this location.'=>'您只有在此处登入。','Log Out Everywhere Else'=>'登出其他设备','Sessions'=>'会话','Confirm use of potentially weak password'=>'确认使用可能的弱密码','Type your new password again.'=>'再输入一遍新密码。','Repeat New Password'=>'重复新密码','Cancel password change'=>'取消密码修改','Generate Password'=>'生成密码','New Password'=>'新密码','Account Management'=>'账户管理','https://en.gravatar.com/'=>'https://cn.gravatar.com/','You can change your profile picture on <a href="%s">Gravatar</a>.'=>'您可以在<a href="%s">Gravatar</a>修改您的资料图片。','Profile Picture'=>'资料图片','Share a little biographical information to fill out your profile. This may be shown publicly.'=>'分享关于您的一些信息。可能会被公开。','Biographical Info'=>'个人说明','About the user'=>'关于该用户','About Yourself'=>'关于您自己','There is a pending change of your email to %s.'=>'您即将修改您的电子邮件地址为%s。','Contact Info'=>'联系信息','Display name publicly as'=>'公开显示为','Nickname'=>'昵称','Last Name'=>'姓氏','First Name'=>'名字','Super admin privileges cannot be removed because this user has the network admin email.'=>'超级管理员权限无法移除：此用户使用站点管理员的电子邮件地址。','Grant this user super admin privileges for the Network.'=>'授予这个用户整个网络的超级管理员权限。','Super Admin'=>'超级管理员','&mdash; No role for this site &mdash;'=>'—这个站点没有任何用户角色—','Usernames cannot be changed.'=>'用户名不可更改。','Show Toolbar when viewing site'=>'在浏览站点时显示工具栏','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Keyboard_Shortcuts" target="_blank">More information</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Keyboard_Shortcuts" target="_blank">更多信息</a>','Enable keyboard shortcuts for comment moderation.'=>'管理评论时启用键盘快捷键。','Disable the visual editor when writing'=>'撰写文章时不使用可视化编辑器','Visual Editor'=>'可视化编辑器','Personal Options'=>'个人设置','userAdd Existing'=>'添加现有用户','Error while saving the new email address. Please try again.'=>'保存新的电子邮件地址时发生错误，请重试。','&larr; Back to Users'=>'&larr; 回到“用户”页面','User updated.'=>'已更新用户。','Profile updated.'=>'个人资料已更新。','This user has super admin privileges.'=>'此用户拥有超级管理员权限。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Users_Your_Profile_Screen">Documentation on User Profiles</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Users_Your_Profile_Screen">用户资料文档</a>','Remember to click the Update Profile button when you are finished.'=>'在完成后不要忘记点击“更新资料”。','Required fields are indicated; the rest are optional. Profile information will only be displayed if your theme is set up to do so.'=>'必填项目有特殊标记，其余是选填项目。个人资料信息仅在主题需要时才可能被显示在站点前台。','You can log out of other devices, such as your phone or a public computer, by clicking the Log Out Everywhere Else button.'=>'您可以通过点击“登出其他设备”按钮来在您的其他设备上登出，如您的手机或公共电脑。','Your username cannot be changed, but you can use other fields to enter your real name or a nickname, and change which name to display on your posts.'=>'您的用户名不能更改，但是您可以在其它栏中输入真实姓名或昵称，即可决定在文章中显示哪个名字。','You can select the language you wish to use while using the WordPress administration screen without affecting the language site visitors see.'=>'您可以选择WordPress管理界面的语言，这不会影响到站点访客所看到的语言。','You can change your password, turn on keyboard shortcuts, change the color scheme of your WordPress administration screens, and turn off the WYSIWYG (Visual) editor, among other things. You can hide the Toolbar (formerly called the Admin Bar) from the front end of your site, however it cannot be disabled on the admin screens.'=>'您可以修改密码、启用键盘快捷键、更换WordPress管理页面配色、关闭所见即所得编辑器等。您也可以在站点前台隐藏工具栏（曾用名：管理工具栏），但是由于它在管理页面是必须的，因此不能在管理页面隐藏。','Your profile contains information about you (your &#8220;account&#8221;) as well as some personal options related to using WordPress.'=>'您的个人资料包含您的个人信息和账户信息，以及使用WordPress的偏好设置。','Edit User %s'=>'编辑用户%s','Error saving media file.'=>'保存媒体文件时发生错误。','%s media file restored from the trash.'=>'已从垃圾箱恢复%s个媒体文件。','Media file restored from the trash.'=>'已从垃圾箱恢复媒体文件。','%s media file moved to the trash.'=>'已移动%s个媒体文件至垃圾箱。','Media file moved to the trash.'=>'已移动媒体文件至垃圾箱。','%s media file permanently deleted.'=>'已永久删除%s个媒体文件。','Media file permanently deleted.'=>'已永久删除媒体文件。','%s media file detached.'=>'已分离%d个媒体文件。','Media file detached.'=>'已分离媒体文件。','%s media file attached.'=>'已附加%s个媒体文件。','Media file attached.'=>'已附加媒体文件。','Media items list'=>'媒体项目列表','Media items list navigation'=>'媒体项目列表导航','Filter media items list'=>'过滤媒体项目列表','If a media file has not been attached to any content, you will see that in the Uploaded To column, and can click on Attach to launch a small popup that will allow you to search for existing content and attach the file.'=>'若某个多媒体文件未被加入任何文章，您将在这个文件的“上传至”栏看到一个“现在添加到文章”链接，点击它，将会弹出一个新的窗口，您可搜索一篇文章并将其加入。','Attaching Files'=>'附加文件','Hovering over a row reveals action links: Edit, Delete Permanently, and View. Clicking Edit or on the media file&#8217;s name displays a simple screen to edit that individual file&#8217;s metadata. Clicking Delete Permanently will delete the file from the media library (as well as from any posts to which it is currently attached). View will take you to the display page for that file.'=>'将鼠标移动到某一行上方，将出现几个新的链接：“编辑”、“永久删除”和“查看”。点击“编辑”或文件名，会出现一个简单的编辑页面，您可用它进行文件属性的编辑；点击“永久删除”将从媒体库中删除该文件（同时，也会从所有包含它的文章中删除）；“查看”将带您到该文件的显示页面。','You can narrow the list by file type/status or by date using the dropdown menus above the media table.'=>'使用列表上方的下拉菜单，您可以通过指定文件类型、状态或日期来过滤列表项。','All the files you&#8217;ve uploaded are listed in the Media Library, with the most recent uploads listed first. You can use the Screen Options tab to customize the display of this screen.'=>'您上传的所有文件都在“媒体库”中列出，按上传时间顺序排列。您可以在“显示选项”选项卡中自定义此页面。','The grid view for the Media Library requires JavaScript. <a href="%s">Switch to the list view</a>.'=>'媒体库的网格视图需要JavaScript支持。<a href="%s">切换回列表视图</a>。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Media_Library_Screen">Documentation on Media Library</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Media_Library_Screen">媒体库文档</a>','You can also delete individual items and access the extended edit screen from the details dialog.'=>'您也可以在此详情对话框中删除单个项目或访问扩展编辑界面。','Use the arrow buttons at the top of the dialog, or the left and right arrow keys on your keyboard, to navigate between media items quickly.'=>'使用对话框顶部的箭头按钮，或键盘上的左右光标键来快速浏览媒体项目。','Clicking an item will display an Attachment Details dialog, which allows you to preview media and make quick edits. Any changes you make to the attachment details will be automatically saved.'=>'点选一个项目将会带出“附件详情”对话框，您可在其中预览媒体并快速做出修改。您对附件详情做出的所有修改都将会自动保存。','To delete media items, click the Bulk Select button at the top of the screen. Select any items you wish to delete, then click the Delete Selected button. Clicking the Cancel Selection button takes you back to viewing your media.'=>'要删除媒体项目，点击顶部的“批量选择”按钮，选择您想要删除的项目，再点击“删除所选”按钮。如您想返回查阅媒体，请点击“取消选择”按钮。','You can view your media in a simple visual grid or a list with columns. Switch between these views using the icons to the left above the media.'=>'您可以网格或列表方式查阅您的媒体。使用媒体左侧的图标来切换这些视图。','All the files you&#8217;ve uploaded are listed in the Media Library, with the most recent uploads listed first.'=>'您上传的所有文件都在“媒体库”中列出，按上传时间顺序排列。','%s seconds'=>'%s秒','%s queries'=>'%s次查询','Your WordPress database has been successfully updated!'=>'您的WordPress数据库已成功升级！','Update Complete'=>'升级完成','Update WordPress Database'=>'升级WordPress数据库','The database update process may take a little while, so please be patient.'=>'数据库升级过程需要一点时间，请耐心等候。','WordPress has been updated! Before we send you on your way, we have to update your database to the newest version.'=>'WordPress已升级，我们需要接着升级您的数据库。','Database Update Required'=>'需要升级数据库','Your WordPress database is already up-to-date!'=>'您的WordPress数据库已经是最新的了！','No Update Required'=>'无需升级','WordPress &rsaquo; Update'=>'WordPress &rsaquo; 升级','Installing Theme from uploaded file: %s'=>'正在安装您上传的主题：%s','Installing Theme: %s'=>'正在安装主题：%s','Install Themes'=>'安装主题','Installing Plugin from uploaded file: %s'=>'正在安装您上传的插件：%s','Installing Plugin: %s'=>'正在安装插件：%s','Plugin failed to reactivate due to a fatal error.'=>'插件重新启用失败，因为发生了一个致命错误（fatal error）。','Plugin reactivated successfully.'=>'插件重新启用成功。','Plugin Reactivation'=>'重新启用插件','Check Again'=>'再次检查','Last checked on %1$s at %2$s.'=>'最后检查于%1$s %2$s。','Please select one or more plugins to update.'=>'请选择需要升级的插件。','Please select one or more themes to update.'=>'请选择需要升级的主题。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Dashboard_Updates_Screen">Documentation on Updating WordPress</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Dashboard_Updates_Screen">升级WordPress文档</a>','How to Update'=>'如何更新','<strong>Translations</strong> &mdash; The files translating WordPress into your language are updated for you whenever any other updates occur. But if these files are out of date, you can <strong>click the &#8220;Update Translations&#8221;</strong> button.'=>'<strong>翻译</strong>——包含WordPress翻译的文件将在任何其他升级发生时一并被升级。如果这些文件已过时，您可<strong>点击“更新翻译”</strong>按钮。','<strong>Themes and Plugins</strong> &mdash; To update individual themes or plugins from this screen, use the checkboxes to make your selection, then <strong>click on the appropriate &#8220;Update&#8221; button</strong>. To update all of your themes or plugins at once, you can check the box at the top of the section to select all before clicking the update button.'=>'<strong>主题和插件</strong>——要在本页面更新主题和插件，使用复选框选择要升级的项目，并<strong>点击对应的“更新”</strong>。选择“主题”区域和“插件”区域最上方的复选框以全选。','In most cases, WordPress will automatically apply maintenance and security updates in the background for you.'=>'在大多数情况下，WordPress会在后台自动为您应用维护和安全更新。','<strong>WordPress</strong> &mdash; Updating your WordPress installation is a simple one-click procedure: just <strong>click on the &#8220;Update Now&#8221; button</strong> when you are notified that a new version is available.'=>'<strong>WordPress</strong>——更新WordPress只需轻点一次鼠标：当有新版本可用时，<strong>点击“更新”按钮</strong>。','If an update is available, you&#8127;ll see a notification appear in the Toolbar and navigation menu.'=>'如果更新可用，您将会在工具栏和导航菜单处看到通知。','On this screen, you can update to the latest version of WordPress, as well as update your themes, plugins, and translations from the WordPress.org repositories.'=>'在这个界面中，您可以将WordPress更新至最新版，也可以从WordPress.org代码库升级您的主题、插件和翻译。','WordPress Updates'=>'WordPress更新','Update WordPress'=>'升级WordPress','New translations are available.'=>'有新的翻译可用。','Your translations are all up to date.'=>'您的所有翻译均为最新版本。','Translations'=>'翻译','Update Themes'=>'升级主题','<strong>Please Note:</strong> Any customizations you have made to theme files will be lost. Please consider using <a href="%s">child themes</a> for modifications.'=>'<strong>请注意：</strong>所有之前对主题文件的修改都将丢失。请考虑使用<a href="%s">子主题</a>方式来对主题做出修改。','The following themes have new versions available. Check the ones you want to update and then click &#8220;Update Themes&#8221;.'=>'以下主题有可用更新，点选需要升级的主题，然后点击“升级主题”。','Your themes are all up to date.'=>'您的所有主题均为最新版本。','You have version %1$s installed. Update to %2$s.'=>'您正在使用的是版本%1$s。升级至%2$s。','View version %s details.'=>'查看版本%s详情。','Compatibility with WordPress %1$s: Unknown'=>'与WordPress %1$s的兼容性：未知','Compatibility with WordPress %1$s: %2$d%% (%3$d "works" votes out of %4$d total)'=>'与WordPress %1$s的兼容性：%2$d%%（%4$d人次投票，其中%3$d位用户表示兼容）','Compatibility with WordPress %1$s: 100%% (according to its author)'=>'与WordPress %1$s的兼容性：100%%（作者自评）','The following plugins have new versions available. Check the ones you want to update and then click &#8220;Update Plugins&#8221;.'=>'以下插件有可用更新，点选需要升级的插件，然后点击“升级插件”。','Your plugins are all up to date.'=>'您的所有插件均为最新版本。','<a href="%s">Learn more about WordPress %s</a>.'=>'<a href="%s">了解关于WordPress %s的更多详情</a>。','While your site is being updated, it will be in maintenance mode. As soon as your updates are complete, your site will return to normal.'=>'当您升级您的站点时，站点将自动进入维护模式。升级完成后会自动退出。','This site is set up to install updates of future beta versions automatically.'=>'本站点被配置为自动安装将来的beta版本。','BETA TESTERS:'=>'BETA测试者：','An updated version of WordPress is available.'=>'有新的WordPress版本可供升级。','<strong>Important:</strong> before updating, please <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/WordPress_Backups">back up your database and files</a>. For help with updates, visit the <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Updating_WordPress">Updating WordPress</a> Codex page.'=>'<strong>重要：</strong>在升级前，请<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/WordPress_Backups">备份您的数据库和文件</a>。要获取与升级有关的帮助，请参见Codex上的<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Updating_WordPress">升级WordPress</a>页面。','Future security updates will be applied automatically.'=>'将来的安全更新将被自动安装。','You have the latest version of WordPress.'=>'您使用的WordPress是最新版本。','Hide hidden updates'=>'不显示隐藏的更新','Show hidden updates'=>'显示隐藏的更新','You are about to install WordPress %s <strong>in English (US).</strong> There is a chance this update will break your translation. You may prefer to wait for the localized version to be released.'=>'您将安装<strong>美式英语版本</strong>的WordPress %s，这可能会破坏您当前使用的翻译。您可等待本地化版本发布后再更新。','This localized version contains both the translation and various other localization fixes. You can skip upgrading if you want to keep your current translation.'=>'当前这个本地化版本包含了翻译等本地化修补。您可暂不升级，以保留当前的翻译。','Bring back this update'=>'再次显示这个更新','Hide this update'=>'隐藏此更新','You can update to <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %2$s</a> automatically:'=>'您可以自动更新到<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %2$s</a>：','You cannot update because <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a> requires MySQL version %2$s or higher. You are running version %3$s.'=>'您不能升级，因为<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a>要求MySQL版本%2$s或更高。您正在运行版本%3$s。','You cannot update because <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a> requires PHP version %2$s or higher. You are running version %3$s.'=>'您不能升级，因为<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a>要求PHP版本%2$s或更高。您正在运行版本%3$s。','You cannot update because <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a> requires PHP version %2$s or higher and MySQL version %3$s or higher. You are running PHP version %4$s and MySQL version %5$s.'=>'您不能升级，因为<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a>要求PHP版本%2$s或更高、与MySQL版本%3$s或更高。您正在运行PHP版本%4$s和MySQL版本%5$s。','Re-install Now'=>'现在重新安装','If you need to re-install version %s, you can do so here:'=>'如果您需要重新安装版本%s，您可以从这里开始：','You are using a development version of WordPress. You can update to the latest nightly build automatically:'=>'您正在使用开发版本的WordPress。您可以自动升级到最新的每夜建构版本：','Sorry, you are not allowed to update this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能更新此站点。','If you want to convert your categories to tags (or vice versa), use the <a href="%s">Categories and Tags Converter</a> available from the Import screen.'=>'如果您想将分类目录转为标签（或者反过来），可以选用“导入”页面上的<a href="%s">分类目录–标签转换器</a>来实现。','Open Press This'=>'打开“快速发布”','Follow the link to open Press This. Then add it to your device&#8217;s bookmarks or home screen.'=>'跟随此链接来开启“快速发布”，然后将其添加到您的设备的收藏夹或主屏幕。','Direct link (best for mobile)'=>'直接链接（适合手机）','If you can&#8217;t drag the bookmarklet to your bookmarks, copy the following code and create a new bookmark. Paste the code into the new bookmark&#8217;s URL field.'=>'如果您无法将这个浏览器书签拖动到您的书签栏，请复制以下代码并创建新书签，将这些代码粘贴入新书签的URL字段。','Copy &#8220;Press This&#8221; bookmarklet code'=>'复制“快速发布”浏览器书签代码','Drag the bookmarklet below to your bookmarks bar. Then, when you&#8217;re on a page you want to share, simply &#8220;press&#8221; it.'=>'将下面的浏览器书签拖动到您的书签栏，然后，当您发现想要共享的页面时，“按”它。','Bookmarklet'=>'浏览器书签','Install Press This'=>'安装“快速发布”','Use Press This to clip text, images and videos from any web page. Then edit and add more straight from Press This before you save or publish it in a post on your site.'=>'用快速发布功能摘取任意网页上的文字、图像和视频。在您保存或发布文章之前都可以通过快速发布功能继续编辑、添加更多内容。','Press This is a little tool that lets you grab bits of the web and create new posts with ease.'=>'“快速发布”是一个能让您抓取网络上的点滴并方便地创建文章的小工具。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Tools_Screen">Documentation on Tools</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Tools_Screen">工具文档</a>','The Categories and Tags Converter link on this screen will take you to the Import screen, where that Converter is one of the plugins you can install. Once that plugin is installed, the Activate Plugin &amp; Run Importer link will take you to a screen where you can choose to convert tags into categories or vice versa.'=>'“分类目录–标签转换器”链接可将您带到“导入”页面。您可在“导入”页面下载转换器插件。安装完成后，点击“启用插件并运行导入工具”，您就可以进行分类目录–标签双向转换了。','Categories have hierarchy, meaning that you can nest sub-categories. Tags do not have hierarchy and cannot be nested. Sometimes people start out using one on their posts, then later realize that the other would work better for their content.'=>'分类目录之间可以有层级关系。标签则没有层级关系，不可嵌套。有时候人们刚开始写文章时会先选择一种方式来使用，然后发现那种方式不太合适。','Press This is a bookmarklet that makes it easy to blog about something you come across on the web. You can use it to just grab a link, or to post an excerpt. Press This will even allow you to choose from images included on the page and use them in your post. Just drag the Press This link on this screen to your bookmarks bar in your browser, and you&#8217;ll be on your way to easier content creation. Clicking on it while on another website opens a popup window with all these options.'=>'“快速发布”是一个允许您快速发表在网络上的所见所闻的浏览器书签。您可使用它获取网页链接，或引用网页中的某段话。“快速发布”甚至可以助您从当前浏览的页面中挑选用于自己文章的图片。只需将“快速发布”链接拖拽或加入到您的浏览器书签栏，然后您就可以更方便地创建自己的内容了。请在浏览其它页面的时候点击此书签。','Press This'=>'快速发布','Update Available'=>'更新可用','Install Parent Theme'=>'安装父主题','theme nameName'=>'名称','The following themes are installed but incomplete.'=>'下列主题已安装但不完整。','Broken Themes'=>'损坏的主题','New version available.'=>'有新版本可用。','New version available. <button class="button-link" type="button">Update now</button>'=>'有新版本可用。<button class="button-link" type="button">现在更新</button>','You cannot delete a theme while it has an active child theme.'=>'您不能删除有已启用子主题的主题。','Theme deleted.'=>'主题已删除。','New theme activated.'=>'新主题已启用。','Visit site'=>'访问站点','Settings saved and theme activated.'=>'设置已保存，主题已启用。','The active theme is broken. Reverting to the default theme.'=>'当前启用的主题已受损。自动切换回默认主题。','Add new themeAdd New'=>'添加','Search installed themes...'=>'搜索已安装的主题…','Search Installed Themes'=>'搜索已安装的主题','Are you sure you want to delete this theme?

Click \'Cancel\' to go back, \'OK\' to confirm the delete.'=>'您确认删除此主题吗？

点击“取消”放弃，点击“确定”删除。','Previewing and Customizing'=>'预览和自定义','When previewing on smaller monitors, you can use the collapse icon at the bottom of the left-hand pane. This will hide the pane, giving you more room to preview your site in the new theme. To bring the pane back, click on the collapse icon again.'=>'在小屏幕设备上预览时，您可点击左下方“收起”图标，然后边栏将收起，留出更多空间显示主题外观。再次点击图标，边栏将展开。','The theme being previewed is fully interactive &mdash; navigate to different pages to see how the theme handles posts, archives, and other page templates. The settings may differ depending on what theme features the theme being previewed supports. To accept the new settings and activate the theme all in one step, click the Save &amp; Activate button above the menu.'=>'当前预览的主题是可互动的——您可以点击不同的页面来查看主题如何显示文章、存档和其他页面模板。根据主题支持的不同，您可以调整的项目也不同。要应用您在实时预览界面的设置，请点击左上角的“保存并启用”。','Tap or hover on any theme then click the Live Preview button to see a live preview of that theme and change theme options in a separate, full-screen view. You can also find a Live Preview button at the bottom of the theme details screen. Any installed theme can be previewed and customized in this way.'=>'轻触或悬浮在任何已安装的主题上，然后点击下方的“实时预览”链接来查看实时预览，并在单独的界面预览并调整主题设置。您也可在主题详情界面的最底找到“实时预览”按钮。任何已安装的主题都可通过此方式预览及自定义。','Adding Themes'=>'主题的添加','If you would like to see more themes to choose from, click on the &#8220;Add New&#8221; button and you will be able to browse or search for additional themes from the <a href="%s">WordPress Theme Directory</a>. Themes in the WordPress Theme Directory are designed and developed by third parties, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses. Oh, and they&#8217;re free!'=>'若您希望从更多主题中选择，请点击“安装主题”选项卡。切换到“安装主题”选项卡后，您就可以在<a href="%s">WordPress.org主题目录</a>中浏览或搜索主题了。WordPress主题目录中的主题是由第三方设计开发的，且与WordPress所用的许可证相兼容。哦对了，它们是免费的！','Installing themes on Multisite can only be done from the Network Admin section.'=>'只能在“管理网络”中为多站点安装主题。','The search for installed themes will search for terms in their name, description, author, or tag.'=>'搜索已安装的主题将在主题的名字、描述、作者和标签中搜索。','The current theme is displayed highlighted as the first theme.'=>'当前主题是高亮显示的第一个主题。','Click Customize for the current theme or Live Preview for any other theme to see a live preview'=>'点击当前主题的自定义按钮或其他主题的实时预览按钮来查看实时预览','Click on the theme to see the theme name, version, author, description, tags, and the Delete link'=>'点击主题以查看主题名称、版本、作者、说明、标签和删除链接','Hover or tap to see Activate and Live Preview buttons'=>'悬浮或轻触以查看启用和实时预览按钮','This screen is used for managing your installed themes. Aside from the default theme(s) included with your WordPress installation, themes are designed and developed by third parties.'=>'此界面用于管理您已安装的主题。与WordPress自带的默认主题不同，这些主题是由第三方设计和开发的。','Manage Themes'=>'管理主题','This theme has not been rated yet.'=>'此主题未被评级。','Button label for a themeNext'=>'下一个','Button label for a themePrevious'=>'上一个','themeDetails &amp; Preview'=>'详情及预览','Themes list'=>'主题列表','Edit Filters'=>'编辑过滤器','Filtering by:'=>'过滤条件：','Clear current filters'=>'清除当前过滤器','Apply Filters'=>'应用过滤器','If you have marked themes as favorites on WordPress.org, you can browse them here.'=>'如果您在WordPress.org上将某主题标记为“最爱”，您即可以在这里浏览它们。','themesFavorites'=>'最爱','themesPopular'=>'热门','Filter themes list'=>'过滤主题列表','The Theme Installer screen requires JavaScript.'=>'主题安装器需要JavaScript支持。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Themes#Adding_New_Themes">Documentation on Adding New Themes</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Themes#Adding_New_Themes">添加新主题文档</a>','Previewing and Installing'=>'预览并安装','To install the theme so you can preview it with your site&#8217;s content and customize its theme options, click the "Install" button at the top of the left-hand pane. The theme files will be downloaded to your website automatically. When this is complete, the theme is now available for activation, which you can do by clicking the "Activate" link, or by navigating to your Manage Themes screen and clicking the "Live Preview" link under any installed theme&#8217;s thumbnail image.'=>'点击左上角“安装”按钮安装主题之后，方可使用“实时预览”功能进行主题自定义。安装后主题文件将被自动下载至您的站点。完成后，您可以使用“启用”链接直接启用主题，或转到“已安装的主题”页面，点击“实时预览”按钮来自定义并预览。','Once you have generated a list of themes, you can preview and install any of them. Click on the thumbnail of the theme you&#8217;re interested in previewing. It will open up in a full-screen Preview page to give you a better idea of how that theme will look.'=>'在产生了主题列表之后，您可以预览、安装其中任意一个。点击主题的缩略图可在新页面全屏预览。','You can Upload a theme manually if you have already downloaded its ZIP archive onto your computer (make sure it is from a trusted and original source). You can also do it the old-fashioned way and copy a downloaded theme&#8217;s folder via FTP into your %s directory.'=>'您可以手动上传从别处下载的zip文件（请确认来源可靠）；也可以使用传统方式，将主题文件拷贝至%s目录中。','Alternately, you can browse the themes that are Featured, Popular, or Latest. When you find a theme you like, you can preview it or install it.'=>'除此以外，您可以浏览特色、热门和最新主题。找到您喜欢的主题后，您可以预览或安装它。','You can Search for themes by keyword, author, or tag, or can get more specific and search by criteria listed in the feature filter.'=>'您可以使用关键词、作者或标签搜索主题，也可以更具体地按特性筛选器中的条件搜索。','You can find additional themes for your site by using the Theme Browser/Installer on this screen, which will display themes from the <a href="%s">WordPress Theme Directory</a>. These themes are designed and developed by third parties, are available free of charge, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses.'=>'通过主题浏览/安装器，您可以为您的站点安装其它主题。主题浏览/安装器显示的是来自<a href="%s">WordPress.org主题目录</a>的主题。这些主题都是由第三方设计开发并免费提供的，且与WordPress所用的许可证相兼容。','Select one or more Theme features to filter by'=>'选择一个或多个主题特征来过滤','Expand Sidebar'=>'展开侧栏','No themes found. Try a different search.'=>'未找到主题，请重新搜索。','Number of Themes found: %d'=>'找到的主题数：%d','Upload Theme'=>'上传主题','Search themes...'=>'搜索主题…','Search Themes'=>'搜索主题','Add New Theme'=>'添加新主题','Add Themes'=>'添加主题','This is a file in your current parent theme.'=>'这是您当前父主题中的一个文件。','Oops, no such file exists! Double check the name and try again, merci.'=>'噢，没有这个文件。请重新检查文件名，然后再试。谢谢。','%s files'=>'%s文件','Theme stylesheets in theme editorStyles'=>'样式','This child theme inherits templates from a parent theme, %s.'=>'此主题使用从父主题“%s”继承下来的模板。','Templates'=>'模板','This theme is broken.'=>'该主题受损。','Select theme to edit:'=>'选择要编辑的主题：','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Template_Tags">Documentation on Template Tags</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Template_Tags">模板标签文档</a>','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Editing_Files">Documentation on Editing Files</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Editing_Files">文件编辑文档</a>','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Themes">Documentation on Using Themes</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Themes">主题使用文档</a>','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Theme_Development">Documentation on Theme Development</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Theme_Development">主题开发文档</a>','Upgrading to a newer version of the same theme will override changes made here. To avoid this, consider creating a <a href="%s">child theme</a> instead.'=>'升级新版本的主题将会导致您所做的修改被覆盖。要避免类似悲剧的发生，请考虑创建一个<a href="%s">子主题</a>。','<strong>Advice:</strong> think very carefully about your site crashing if you are live-editing the theme currently in use.'=>'<strong>建议：</strong>若您编辑您正在使用的主题，编辑不当则可能造成站点的故障。','After typing in your edits, click Update File.'=>'当编辑完成时，请点击“上传文件”。','For PHP files, you can use the Documentation dropdown to select from functions recognized in that file. Look Up takes you to a web page with reference material about that particular function.'=>'对于PHP文件，您可以使用“文档”下拉列表选择我们从文件中识别出的函数。点击“查询”按钮可查看有关该函数的参考页面。','Begin by choosing a theme to edit from the dropdown menu and clicking the Select button. A list then appears of the theme&#8217;s template files. Clicking once on any file name causes the file to appear in the large Editor box.'=>'自下拉菜单或点击“选择”选取您想要编辑的主题并开始。列表中会出现全部的模板文件。点击任何文件即可将它载入编辑框内。','You can use the Theme Editor to edit the individual CSS and PHP files which make up your theme.'=>'您可以使用“主题编辑器”来编辑主题中包含的CSS和PHP文件。','Edit Themes'=>'编辑主题','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit templates for this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能在此站点上编辑模板。','All right, sparky! You&#8217;ve made it through this part of the installation. WordPress can now communicate with your database. If you are ready, time now to&hellip;'=>'不错。您完成了安装过程中重要的一步，WordPress现在已经可以连接数据库了。如果您准备好了的话，现在就&hellip;','Successful database connection'=>'数据库连接成功','Run the install'=>'进行安装','After you&#8217;ve done that, click &#8220;Run the install.&#8221;'=>'完成之后，请点击“进行安装”。','You can create the %s manually and paste the following text into it.'=>'您可以手工创建%s文件并将以下信息贴入其中。','Sorry, but I can&#8217;t write the %s file.'=>'抱歉，我不能写入%s文件。','<strong>ERROR</strong>: "Table Prefix" is invalid.'=>'<strong>错误</strong>：“表前缀”无效。','If you want to run multiple WordPress installations in a single database, change this.'=>'如果您希望在同一个数据库安装多个WordPress，请修改前缀。','Table Prefix'=>'表前缀','You should be able to get this info from your web host, if %s doesn&#8217;t work.'=>'如果%s不能用，您通常可以从主机提供商处得到正确的信息。','Database Host'=>'数据库主机','Your database password.'=>'您的数据库密码。','example passwordpassword'=>'密码','Your database username.'=>'您的数据库用户名。','example usernameusername'=>'用户名','The name of the database you want to use with WordPress.'=>'希望将WordPress安装到的数据库名称。','Database Name'=>'数据库名','Below you should enter your database connection details. If you&#8217;re not sure about these, contact your host.'=>'请在下方填写您的数据库连接信息。如果您不确定，请联系您的服务提供商。','Set up your database connection'=>'设置您的数据库连接','Let&#8217;s go!'=>'现在就开始！','In all likelihood, these items were supplied to you by your Web Host. If you don&#8217;t have this information, then you will need to contact them before you can continue. If you&#8217;re all ready&hellip;'=>'绝大多数时候，您的网站服务提供商会给您这些信息。如果您没有这些信息，在继续之前您将需要联系他们。如果您准备好了…','Need more help? <a href="%s">We got it</a>.'=>'需要更多帮助？<a href="%s">看这里</a>。','If for any reason this automatic file creation doesn&#8217;t work, don&#8217;t worry. All this does is fill in the database information to a configuration file. You may also simply open %1$s in a text editor, fill in your information, and save it as %2$s.'=>'如果自动创建未能成功，不用担心，您要做的只是将数据库信息填入配置文件。您也可以在文本编辑器中打开%1$s，填入您的信息，并将其另存为%2$s。','We&#8217;re going to use this information to create a %s file.'=>'我们会使用这些信息来创建一个%s文件。','Table prefix (if you want to run more than one WordPress in a single database)'=>'数据表前缀（table prefix，特别是当您要在一个数据库中安装多个WordPress时）','Database host'=>'数据库主机','Database password'=>'数据库密码','Database username'=>'数据库用户名','Database name'=>'数据库名','Welcome to WordPress. Before getting started, we need some information on the database. You will need to know the following items before proceeding.'=>'欢迎使用WordPress。在开始前，我们需要您数据库的一些信息。请准备好如下信息。','Before getting started'=>'开始之前','WordPress &rsaquo; Setup Configuration File'=>'WordPress &rsaquo; 调整配置文件','The file \'wp-config.php\' already exists one level above your WordPress installation. If you need to reset any of the configuration items in this file, please delete it first. You may try <a href=\'%s\'>installing now</a>.'=>'“wp-config.php”文件在您的WordPress安装的上级目录已经存在。如果您需要重设此文件中定义的任何设置项，请先删除它。您也可以<a href=\'%s\'>现在安装</a>。','The file \'wp-config.php\' already exists. If you need to reset any of the configuration items in this file, please delete it first. You may try <a href=\'%s\'>installing now</a>.'=>'wp-config.php文件已存在。如果您需要重置配置选项，请先删除该文件。您可以尝试<a href=\'%s\'>立即使用当前配置进行安装</a>。','Sorry, I need a wp-config-sample.php file to work from. Please re-upload this file to your WordPress installation.'=>'抱歉，我需要wp-config-sample.php文件来开始工作。请重新上传此文件到您的WordPress安装中。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Revision_Management">Revisions Management</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Revision_Management">版本管理</a>','To restore a revision, <strong>click Restore This Revision</strong>.'=>'要恢复一个修订版本，<strong>点击“恢复此版本”</strong>。','Compare two different revisions by <strong>selecting the &#8220;Compare any two revisions&#8221; box</strong> to the side.'=>'通过在侧面<strong>选择“比较两个版本”模块</strong>来比较两个不同的修订版本。','To navigate between revisions, <strong>drag the slider handle left or right</strong> or <strong>use the Previous or Next buttons</strong>.'=>'要在修订版本间移动，请<strong>将滑块向左右拖动</strong>或</strong>使用“上一个”或“下一个”按钮</strong>。','From this screen you can review, compare, and restore revisions:'=>'在此页您可审阅、比较和恢复修订版本：','Revisions are saved copies of your post or page, which are periodically created as you update your content. The red text on the left shows the content that was removed. The green text on the right shows the content that was added.'=>'修订版本是在您编修您的文章和页面时，定期创建的拷贝。左边的红字表记了删除的内容，右边的绿字表记了加入的内容。','This screen is used for managing your content revisions.'=>'在此页您可管理内容的修订版本。','&larr; Return to editor'=>'&larr; 返回编辑器','Compare Revisions of &#8220;%1$s&#8221;'=>'比较《%1$s》的修订版本','This item has already been deleted.'=>'此项目已被删除。','The item you are trying to restore from the Trash no longer exists.'=>'您试图从回收站恢复的项目已不存在。','You cannot move this item to the Trash. %s is currently editing.'=>'您不能移动此项目到回收站。%s正在编辑。','The item you are trying to move to the Trash no longer exists.'=>'您试图移动到回收站的项目已不存在。','You can&#8217;t edit this item because it is in the Trash. Please restore it and try again.'=>'您无法编辑该条目，因为它现在在回收站中。请先将其恢复，然后再重试。','Unable to submit this form, please refresh and try again.'=>'未能提交此表单，请刷新并重试。','Search Installed Plugins'=>'搜索已安装插件','All selected plugins are up to date.'=>'所有选择的插件都是最新的。','Selected plugins <strong>deactivated</strong>.'=>'选中插件<strong>已停用</strong>。','Plugin <strong>deactivated</strong>.'=>'插件<strong>已停用</strong>。','Selected plugins <strong>activated</strong>.'=>'选中插件<strong>已启用</strong>。','Plugin <strong>activated</strong>.'=>'插件<strong>已启用</strong>。','The selected plugins have been <strong>deleted</strong>.'=>'所选插件<strong>已删除</strong>。','The selected plugin has been <strong>deleted</strong>.'=>'选择的插件已被<strong>删除</strong>。','Plugin could not be deleted due to an error: %s'=>'无法删除插件，因为发生了错误：%s','Plugin could not be activated because it triggered a <strong>fatal error</strong>.'=>'无法启用插件，因为它引起了一个<strong>致命错误</strong>（fatal error）。','The plugin generated %d characters of <strong>unexpected output</strong> during activation. If you notice &#8220;headers already sent&#8221; messages, problems with syndication feeds or other issues, try deactivating or removing this plugin.'=>'这个插件在启用的过程中产生了%d个字符的<strong>异常输出</strong>。如果您遇到了“headers already sent”错误、联合feed（如RSS）出错等问题，请尝试禁用或移除本插件。','The plugin %1$s has been <strong>deactivated</strong> due to an error: %2$s'=>'插件%1$s已被<strong>禁用</strong>，因为以下错误：%2$s','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Managing_Plugins#Plugin_Management">Documentation on Managing Plugins</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Managing_Plugins#Plugin_Management">管理插件文档</a>','If something goes wrong with a plugin and you can&#8217;t use WordPress, delete or rename that file in the %s directory and it will be automatically deactivated.'=>'如果因为插件出现问题而让您无法使用WordPress，您可以删除或重命名%s目录中的那个文件，其就会被自动禁用。','Most of the time, plugins play nicely with the core of WordPress and with other plugins. Sometimes, though, a plugin&#8217;s code will get in the way of another plugin, causing compatibility issues. If your site starts doing strange things, this may be the problem. Try deactivating all your plugins and re-activating them in various combinations until you isolate which one(s) caused the issue.'=>'通常每个插件都能和其他插件以及WordPress核心程序正常工作。但是，有的时候某些插件会和其他插件相冲突，进而产生兼容性问题。如果您的站点工作异常，可能是这个原因导致的。您可尝试禁用所有插件，再逐个启用，以排除问题。','Troubleshooting'=>'故障排除','If you would like to see more plugins to choose from, click on the &#8220;Add New&#8221; button and you will be able to browse or search for additional plugins from the <a href="%s">WordPress Plugin Directory</a>. Plugins in the WordPress Plugin Directory are designed and developed by third parties, and are compatible with the license WordPress uses. Oh, and they&#8217;re free!'=>'若您希望从更多主题中选择，请点击“安装主题”选项卡。切换到“安装主题”选项卡后，您就可以在<a href="%s">WordPress.org主题目录</a>中浏览或搜索主题了。WordPress主题目录中的主题是由第三方设计开发的，且与WordPress所用的许可证相兼容。哦对了，它们是免费的！','The search for installed plugins will search for terms in their name, description, or author.'=>'搜索已安装的插件将在主题的名字、描述、作者和标签中搜索。','Plugins extend and expand the functionality of WordPress. Once a plugin is installed, you may activate it or deactivate it here.'=>'插件拓展、拓充WordPress的功能。插件安装后，您可以在这里启用或者禁用它。','No, return me to the plugin list'=>'不，返回到插件列表','Yes, delete these files'=>'是，删除这些文件','Yes, delete these files and data'=>'是，删除这些文件和数据','Are you sure you wish to delete these files?'=>'您确定要删除这些文件吗？','Are you sure you wish to delete these files and data?'=>'您确定删除这些文件和数据？','plugin%1$s by %2$s'=>'由%2$s制作的%1$s','%1$s by %2$s (will also <strong>delete its data</strong>)'=>'由%2$s制作的%1$s（<strong>其数据也将被一并删除</strong>）','You are about to remove the following plugins:'=>'您将要删除以下插件：','These plugins may be active on other sites in the network.'=>'这些插件可能已在网络的其它站点中启用了。','Delete Plugins'=>'删除插件','You are about to remove the following plugin:'=>'您将要删除以下插件：','This plugin may be active on other sites in the network.'=>'这个插件可能已在网络的其它站点中启用了。','Delete Plugin'=>'删除插件','Sorry, you are not allowed to deactivate plugins for this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能在此站点上禁用插件。','Update Plugins'=>'升级插件','Sorry, you are not allowed to activate plugins for this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能在在此站点上启用插件。','Browse Plugins'=>'浏览插件','Plugins list'=>'插件列表','Plugins list navigation'=>'插件列表导航','Filter plugins list'=>'过滤插件列表','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Plugins_Add_New_Screen">Documentation on Installing Plugins</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Plugins_Add_New_Screen">安装插件文档</a>','If you want to install a plugin that you&#8217;ve downloaded elsewhere, click the Upload Plugin button above the plugins list. You will be prompted to upload the .zip package, and once uploaded, you can activate the new plugin.'=>'如果您想安装从别处下载的插件，请点击列表上方的“上传”。WordPress接受.zip格式的压缩包，在上传成功后，您可启用该插件。','You can also browse a user&#8217;s favorite plugins, by using the Favorites link above the plugins list and entering their WordPress.org username.'=>'您也可以浏览他人收藏的插件。点击列表上方的“收藏”链接，然后输入一个用户名。','If you just want to get an idea of what&#8217;s available, you can browse Featured and Popular plugins by using the links above the plugins list. These sections rotate regularly.'=>'若您只想知道有什么插件可以选择，您可从列表上方的“特色”、“热门”中浏览。这些内容定期更新。','If you know what you&#8217;re looking for, Search is your best bet. The Search screen has options to search the WordPress Plugin Directory for a particular Term, Author, or Tag. You can also search the directory by selecting popular tags. Tags in larger type mean more plugins have been labeled with that tag.'=>'若您知道您需要何种插件，请使用“搜索”功能。搜索页面根据您提供的相关短语、作者或插件标签在WordPress插件目录搜索。您也可以通过“热门标签”来浏览插件目录。标签字体越大，说明使用该标签的插件越多。','Adding Plugins'=>'插件的添加','You can find new plugins to install by searching or browsing the directory right here in your own Plugins section.'=>'您可以在您的插件一节通过搜索或浏览目录来找到并安装新插件。','Plugins hook into WordPress to extend its functionality with custom features. Plugins are developed independently from the core WordPress application by thousands of developers all over the world. All plugins in the official <a href="%s">WordPress Plugin Directory</a> are compatible with the license WordPress uses.'=>'插件利用WordPress的钩子机制来扩展WordPress的功能，同时与WordPress核心应用程序相对独立。它们是由全球各地数以千计的开发者开发的。所有在官方<a href="%s">WordPress.org插件目录</a>中的插件都与WordPress所用的许可证相兼容。您现在就可以在您站点仪表盘的“插件”区域搜索和浏览目录中的插件。','Add Plugins'=>'添加插件','You need to make this file writable before you can save your changes. See <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">the Codex</a> for more information.'=>'在您保存修改前，您需要将此文件设置为可写。参见<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">Codex</a>来获取更多资讯。','Update File'=>'更新文件','Update File and Attempt to Reactivate'=>'更新文件并尝试重新启用','<strong>Warning:</strong> Making changes to active plugins is not recommended. If your changes cause a fatal error, the plugin will be automatically deactivated.'=>'<strong>注意</strong>：不推荐对当前启用的插件做修改。如果您的修改导致致命错误（fatal error），插件会被自动停用。','Look Up'=>'查询','Documentation:'=>'文档：','Plugin Files'=>'插件文件','Select plugin to edit:'=>'选择要编辑的插件：','Browsing %s (inactive)'=>'正在浏览%s（未启用）','Editing %s (inactive)'=>'正在编辑%s（未启用）','Browsing %s (active)'=>'正在浏览%s（已启用）','Editing %s (active)'=>'正在编辑%s（已启用）','This plugin has been deactivated because your changes resulted in a <strong>fatal error</strong>.'=>'该插件已被停用，因为您的修改导致了一个<strong>致命错误</strong>（fatal error）。','File edited successfully.'=>'文件修改成功。','Function Name&hellip;'=>'函数名&hellip;','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Writing_a_Plugin">Documentation on Writing Plugins</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Writing_a_Plugin">撰写插件文档</a>','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Plugins_Editor_Screen">Documentation on Editing Plugins</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Plugins_Editor_Screen">编辑插件文档</a>','Any edits to files from this screen will be reflected on all sites in the network.'=>'在本页面对文件做出的一切更改，都将影响整个网络。','If you want to make changes but don&#8217;t want them to be overwritten when the plugin is updated, you may be ready to think about writing your own plugin. For information on how to edit plugins, write your own from scratch, or just better understand their anatomy, check out the links below.'=>'若您不希望您所做的修改因插件升级而被覆盖，请考虑自己编写插件。右侧的链接提供了自行制作插件的一些方法和指导。','In the editing area the Tab key enters a tab character. To move below this area by pressing Tab, press the Esc key followed by the Tab key. In some cases the Esc key will need to be pressed twice before the Tab key will allow you to continue.'=>'在编辑区域中，制表键会插入制表符。要通过制表键移动到下方区域，请先按退出键再按制表键。有些时候您可能需要按两次退出键，然后才能按制表键继续。','The Documentation menu below the editor lists the PHP functions recognized in the plugin file. Clicking Look Up takes you to a web page about that particular function.'=>'“文档”菜单列出了我们从该文件中找到的所有函数。点击“查询”按钮可查看有关该函数的页面。','Choose a plugin to edit from the dropdown menu and click the Select button. Click once on any file name to load it in the editor, and make your changes. Don&#8217;t forget to save your changes (Update File) when you&#8217;re finished.'=>'请从下拉菜单中选择要编辑的插件，然后点选您希望编辑的文件。请在完成后请不要忘记保存（点击“上传文件”）。','You can use the editor to make changes to any of your plugins&#8217; individual PHP files. Be aware that if you make changes, plugins updates will overwrite your customizations.'=>'您可以使用本编辑器编辑任何插件的PHP文件。请注意，若您更新了插件，所有的修改将被新版本覆盖。','Files of this type are not editable.'=>'无法编辑该类型的文件。','No such file exists! Double check the name and try again.'=>'文件不存在。请重新检查文件名，然后再试。','Edit Plugins'=>'编辑插件','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit plugins for this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能编辑此站点的插件。','All Settings'=>'全部设置','The %s setting is unregistered. Unregistered settings are deprecated. See https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_API'=>'%s设置未被注册。未注册的设置已被废弃，请参见https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_API','Sorry, you are not allowed to modify unregistered settings for this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能修改此站点的未注册设置。','<strong>ERROR</strong>: options page not found.'=>'<strong>错误</strong>：未找到选项页面。','Sorry, you are not allowed to manage these options.'=>'抱歉，您不能管理这些选项。','WordPress is not notifying any <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Update_Services">Update Services</a> because of your site&#8217;s <a href="%s">visibility settings</a>.'=>'WordPress不会通知<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Update_Services">更新服务</a>，基于您站点的<a href="%s">公开度设置</a>。','When you publish a new post, WordPress automatically notifies the following site update services. For more about this, see <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Update_Services">Update Services</a> on the Codex. Separate multiple service URLs with line breaks.'=>'在您发表新文章时，WordPress会自动通知站点更新服务。要获取更多资讯，请参见Codex上的<a href=\\"https://codex.wordpress.org/Update_Services\\">更新服务</a>。用换行分隔多个服务URL。','Default Mail Category'=>'默认邮件发表分类目录','Login Name'=>'登录名','Port'=>'端口','Mail Server'=>'邮件服务器','To post to WordPress by email you must set up a secret email account with POP3 access. Any mail received at this address will be posted, so it&#8217;s a good idea to keep this address very secret. Here are three random strings you could use: %1$s, %2$s, %3$s.'=>'通过电子邮件发布设定能让您通过发送您文章的内容到WordPress来发布。此信箱接收到的任何信件都将被发布，所以将此地址保密是一个好主意。以下是一些随机字符串供您使用：%1$s、%2$s、%3$s。','Post via email'=>'通过电子邮件发布','Default Link Category'=>'默认链接分类目录','Default Post Format'=>'默认文章形式','Default Post Category'=>'默认文章分类目录','WordPress should correct invalidly nested XHTML automatically'=>'让WordPress自动校正嵌套错误的XHTML代码','Convert emoticons like <code>:-)</code> and <code>:-P</code> to graphics on display'=>'转换如<code>:-)</code>、<code>:-P</code>等文本表情符号为图像','Formatting'=>'格式','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Writing_Screen">Documentation on Writing Settings</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Writing_Screen">写作设置文档</a>','If desired, WordPress will automatically alert various services of your new posts.'=>'如有需要，WordPress可自动在您发布新文章时通知若干网络服务。','Update Services'=>'更新服务','Post via email settings allow you to send your WordPress install an email with the content of your post. You must set up a secret email account with POP3 access to use this, and any mail received at this address will be posted, so it&#8217;s a good idea to keep this address very secret.'=>'通过电子邮件发布设定能让您通过发送您文章的内容到WordPress来发布。您必须设定一个支持POP3的秘密电子邮件账号才能使用此功能。此信箱接收到的任何信件都将被发布，所以将此地址保密是一个好主意。','Post Via Email'=>'通过电子邮件发布','You can submit content in several different ways; this screen holds the settings for all of them. The top section controls the editor within the dashboard, while the rest control external publishing methods. For more information on any of these methods, use the documentation links.'=>'您可以在本页面设定撰写文章的方式。顶端的几个选项是有关在WordPress仪表盘的编辑选项；剩余的项目与通过其他发布方式有关。欲了解关于其它发布方式的信息，请参考文档链接。','Writing Settings'=>'撰写设置','Summary'=>'摘要','Full text'=>'全文','For each article in a feed, show'=>'对于feed中的每篇文章，显示','items'=>'个项目','Syndication feeds show the most recent'=>'Feed中显示最近','posts'=>'篇文章','Blog pages show at most'=>'博客页面至多显示','<strong>Warning:</strong> these pages should not be the same!'=>'<strong>警告：</strong>二者不能为同一页面！','Posts page: %s'=>'文章页：%s','Front page: %s'=>'主页：%s','A <a href="%s">static page</a> (select below)'=>'一个<a href="%s">静态页面</a>（在下方选择）','Encoding for pages and feeds'=>'页面和feed编码','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Reading_Screen">Documentation on Reading Settings</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Reading_Screen">阅读设置文档</a>','When this setting is in effect, a reminder is shown in the At a Glance box of the Dashboard that says, &#8220;Search Engines Discouraged,&#8221; to remind you that your site is not being crawled.'=>'当该项设置生效时，仪表盘中的“概况”模块将提醒您“自动建议搜索引擎不抓取”。您的站点在屏蔽搜索引擎期间无法被搜索引擎收录。','You can choose whether or not your site will be crawled by robots, ping services, and spiders. If you want those services to ignore your site, click the checkbox next to &#8220;Discourage search engines from indexing this site&#8221; and click the Save Changes button at the bottom of the screen. Note that your privacy is not complete; your site is still visible on the web.'=>'您可以决定是否让索引工具、搜索引擎爬虫、ping服务访问您的站点。如果您不希望它们访问您的站点，请选择“建议搜索引擎不索引本站点”，并点击下方的“保存更改”。请注意，您的站点将依然在互联网上公开。','You can also control the display of your content in RSS feeds, including the maximum number of posts to display and whether to show full text or a summary.'=>'您也可以控制RSS feed的显示方式：最大输出文章数、全文输出或仅输出摘要。','You can choose what&#8217;s displayed on the front page of your site. It can be posts in reverse chronological order (classic blog), or a fixed/static page. To set a static home page, you first need to create two <a href="%s">Pages</a>. One will become the front page, and the other will be where your posts are displayed.'=>'您可以决定在站点首页上显示什么。可以以时间顺序列出文章；也可以显示一个静态页面。要使用静态页面作为首页，您需要<a href="%s">创建两个页面</a>。一个用做首页，另一个用来显示文章。','This screen contains the settings that affect the display of your content.'=>'本页面提供有关站点内容显示方式的选项。','Reading Settings'=>'阅读设置','If your <code>.htaccess</code> file were <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">writable</a>, we could do this automatically, but it isn&#8217;t so these are the mod_rewrite rules you should have in your <code>.htaccess</code> file. Click in the field and press <kbd>CTRL + a</kbd> to select all.'=>'如果您的<code>.htaccess</code>文件<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">可写</a>，我们即会自动帮您完成，但其目前不可写，所以以下是您需要加入您的<code>.htaccess</code>文件中的mod_rewrite规则。点击文本框并按<kbd>CTRL + a</kbd>来全选。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Nginx">Documentation on Nginx configuration</a>.'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Nginx">Nginx配置文档</a>。','If you temporarily make your site&#8217;s root directory writable for us to generate the <code>web.config</code> file automatically, do not forget to revert the permissions after the file has been created.'=>'如果您暂时将您的站点根目录设置为可写供我们自动创建<code>web.config</code>文件，请不要忘记在文件创建完成后恢复相应的权限。','If the root directory of your site were <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">writable</a>, we could do this automatically, but it isn&#8217;t so this is the url rewrite rule you should have in your <code>web.config</code> file. Create a new file, called <code>web.config</code> in the root directory of your site. Click in the field and press <kbd>CTRL + a</kbd> to select all. Then insert this code into the <code>web.config</code> file.'=>'如果您的站点根目录<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">可写</a>，我们即会自动帮您完成，但其目前不可写，所以以下是您需要加入您的<code>web.config</code>文件中的URL重写规则。请在站点根目录中创建名为<code>web.config</code>的文件，点击文本框并按<kbd>CTRL + a</kbd>来全选，并粘贴入<code>web.config</code>文件。','If you temporarily make your <code>web.config</code> file writable for us to generate rewrite rules automatically, do not forget to revert the permissions after rule has been saved.'=>'如果您暂时将<code>web.config</code>文件设置为可写，请在规则保存后恢复其原有权限。','If your <code>web.config</code> file were <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">writable</a>, we could do this automatically, but it isn&#8217;t so this is the url rewrite rule you should have in your <code>web.config</code> file. Click in the field and press <kbd>CTRL + a</kbd> to select all. Then insert this rule inside of the <code>/&lt;configuration&gt;/&lt;system.webServer&gt;/&lt;rewrite&gt;/&lt;rules&gt;</code> element in <code>web.config</code> file.'=>'如果您的<code>web.config </code>文件<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Changing_File_Permissions">可写</a>，我们即会自动帮您完成，但其目前不可写，所以以下是您需要加入您的<code>web.config</code>文件中的URL重写规则。点击文本框并按<kbd>CTRL + a</kbd>来全选，然后将其粘贴入<code>web.config</code>内的<code>/&lt;configuration&gt;/&lt;system.webServer&gt;/&lt;rewrite&gt;/&lt;rules&gt;</code>元素中。','Tag base'=>'标签前缀','Category base'=>'分类目录前缀','If you like, you may enter custom structures for your category and tag URLs here. For example, using <code>topics</code> as your category base would make your category links like <code>%s/topics/uncategorized/</code>. If you leave these blank the defaults will be used.'=>'如果您喜欢，您可以在此给您的分类和标签自定义URL。比如，使用<code>topics</code>作为您的分类基础将会使您的分类链接变成<code>%s/topics/uncategorized/</code>。如果您留空此处，默认值将被使用。','Optional'=>'可选','Custom Structure'=>'自定义结构','Post name'=>'文章名','Numeric'=>'数字型','Month and name'=>'月份和名称型','sample permalink structuresample-post'=>'sample-post','Day and name'=>'日期和名称型','Plain'=>'朴素','Common Settings'=>'常用设置','sample permalink basearchives'=>'archives','WordPress offers you the ability to create a custom URL structure for your permalinks and archives. Custom URL structures can improve the aesthetics, usability, and forward-compatibility of your links. A <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Permalinks">number of tags are available</a>, and here are some examples to get you started.'=>'WordPress让您能够为您的永久链接和存档建立自定义URL结构。自定义URL结构可以为您的链接提高美感、可用性和前向兼容性。这里有<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Permalinks">一些可用的标签</a>，以及一些入门范例。','You should update your .htaccess now.'=>'您现在需要手工更新您的.htaccess文件。','Permalink structure updated. Remove write access on web.config file now!'=>'固定链接结构已更新。请去除web.config文件的写权限！','You should update your web.config now.'=>'您现在需要更新web.config文件。','Permalink structure updated.'=>'固定链接结构已更新。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Permalinks">Documentation on Using Permalinks</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Using_Permalinks">永久链接使用文档</a>','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Permalinks_Screen">Documentation on Permalinks Settings</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Permalinks_Screen">永久链接设置文档</a>','The Optional fields let you customize the &#8220;category&#8221; and &#8220;tag&#8221; base names that will appear in archive URLs. For example, the page listing all posts in the &#8220;Uncategorized&#8221; category could be <code>/topics/uncategorized</code> instead of <code>/category/uncategorized</code>.'=>'“可选”栏允许您在文章归档的URL中加入分类名和标签名。比如，“未分类”目录的文章归档页面的地址可以是<code>/topics/uncategorized</code>（默认情况下是<code>/category/uncategorized</code>）。','Custom Structures'=>'自定义结构','When you assign multiple categories or tags to a post, only one can show up in the permalink: the lowest numbered category. This applies if your custom structure includes <code>%category%</code> or <code>%tag%</code>.'=>'若您某篇文章包含多个分类目录或标签，且自定义链接结构包含<code>%category%</code>或<code>%tag%</code>，则只有排序最靠前的分类目录或标签才会显示在固定链接中。','If you pick an option other than Plain, your general URL path with structure tags (terms surrounded by <code>%</code>) will also appear in the custom structure field and your path can be further modified there.'=>'如果您选择了“朴素”以外的选项，您的带有结构标签（被<code>%</code>包含的词）的通用URL路径也将出现在自定义结构字段，您将可以在那里进一步修改您的路径。','Permalinks can contain useful information, such as the post date, title, or other elements. You can choose from any of the suggested permalink formats, or you can craft your own if you select Custom Structure.'=>'固定链接可以包含有用的信息，如发布日期、标题或其它元素。您可以从推荐的固定链接格式种选择，也可以选择“自定义结构”来创建您自己的格式。','This screen allows you to choose your permalink structure. You can choose from common settings or create custom URL structures.'=>'此界面可以让您选择您的固定链接结构。您可以选择常见的设置或建立自定义URL结构。','Permalinks are the permanent URLs to your individual pages and blog posts, as well as your category and tag archives. A permalink is the web address used to link to your content. The URL to each post should be permanent, and never change &#8212; hence the name permalink.'=>'固定链接是指向您的文章、页面、分类目录归档和标签归档等网页的固定URL。之所以称之为“固定链接”，是因为链接到每篇文章的URL应该永远固定，不应修改。','Permalink Settings'=>'固定链接设置','Organize my uploads into month- and year-based folders'=>'以年—月目录形式组织上传内容','Configuring this is optional. By default, it should be blank.'=>'可选配置，默认留空。','Full URL path to files'=>'文件的完整URL地址','Default is %s'=>'缺省为%s','Store uploads in this folder'=>'默认上传路径','Uploading Files'=>'文件上传','Embeds'=>'嵌入','Large size'=>'大尺寸','Max Height'=>'最大高度','Max Width'=>'最大宽度','Medium size'=>'中等大小','Crop thumbnail to exact dimensions (normally thumbnails are proportional)'=>'总是裁剪缩略图到这个尺寸（一般情况下，缩略图应保持原始比例）','Thumbnail size'=>'缩略图大小','The sizes listed below determine the maximum dimensions in pixels to use when adding an image to the Media Library.'=>'下面列出来的尺寸决定插入媒体库内的图像之最大尺寸。以像素为单位。','Image sizes'=>'图像大小','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Media_Screen">Documentation on Media Settings</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Media_Screen">媒体设置文档</a>','Uploading Files allows you to choose the folder and path for storing your uploaded files.'=>'“文件上传”的内容决定存放您上传文件的目录和路径。','You can set maximum sizes for images inserted into your written content; you can also insert an image as Full Size.'=>'您可以为插入文中的图片设置最大尺寸。亦可以“全尺寸”插入图片。','Media Settings'=>'媒体设置','Week Starts On'=>'一星期开始于','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Formatting_Date_and_Time">Documentation on date and time formatting</a>.'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Formatting_Date_and_Time">日期和时间格式帮助</a>.','Custom time format:'=>'自定义时间格式：','enter a custom time format in the following field'=>'在下框中输入自定义时间格式','example:'=>'例子：','Custom date format:'=>'自定义日期格式：','enter a custom date format in the following field'=>'在下框中输入自定义日期格式','Custom:'=>'自定义：','This timezone does not observe daylight saving time.'=>'该时区不实施夏令时。','Standard time begins on: %s.'=>'标准时间于此开始：%s。','Daylight saving time begins on: %s.'=>'日光节约时间于此开始：%s。','This timezone is currently in standard time.'=>'该时区当前使用标准时间。','This timezone is currently in daylight saving time.'=>'该时区目前使用夏令时制。','Local time is %s.'=>'当地时间为%s。','Universal time (%1$s) is %2$s.'=>'协调世界时（%1$s）为%2$s。','Choose either a city in the same timezone as you or a UTC timezone offset.'=>'选择与您在同一时区的城市或UTC时区偏移。','Timezone'=>'时区','The %s constant in your %s file is no longer needed.'=>'您的%2$s文件中的%1$s常量已不再需要。','Site Language'=>'站点语言','There is a pending change of the admin email to %s.'=>'您即将修改管理电子邮件地址为%s。','This address is used for admin purposes. If you change this we will send you an email at your new address to confirm it. <strong>The new address will not become active until confirmed.</strong>'=>'这个地址将被用于管理目的。如果您修改这个地址，我们将会向新地址发送电子邮件来确认。<strong>新地址直到获得确认才会启用。</strong>','New User Default Role'=>'新用户默认角色','Anyone can register'=>'任何人都可以注册','Membership'=>'成员资格','Email Address'=>'电子邮件地址','Enter the address here if you <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Giving_WordPress_Its_Own_Directory">want your site home page to be different from your WordPress installation directory.</a>'=>'如果您想<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Giving_WordPress_Its_Own_Directory">让您的站点主页与WordPress安装目录不同</a>，请在此输入地址。','In a few words, explain what this site is about.'=>'用简洁的文字描述本站点。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_General_Screen">Documentation on General Settings</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_General_Screen">通用设置文档</a>','UTC means Coordinated Universal Time.'=>'UTC是世界协调时间。','You can set the language, and the translation files will be automatically downloaded and installed (available if your filesystem is writable).'=>'您可以设置语言，翻译文件将被自动下载并安装（如果您的文件系统可写）。','If you want site visitors to be able to register themselves, as opposed to by the site administrator, check the membership box. A default user role can be set for all new users, whether self-registered or registered by the site admin.'=>'如果您希望允许访客自行注册（另外一种方式是由站点管理员代为注册），请勾选“成员资格”复选框。默认用户角色应用于所有新注册的用户，不论其是由管理员代为注册，抑或是自行注册。','The WordPress URL and the Site URL can be the same (example.com) or different; for example, having the WordPress core files (example.com/wordpress) in a subdirectory instead of the root directory.'=>'“WordPress URL”和“站点URL”可以相同，也可以不同。比如说，WordPress的核心文件（example.com/wordpress）可以不置于根目录，而在子目录。','Most themes display the site title at the top of every page, in the title bar of the browser, and as the identifying name for syndicated feeds. The tagline is also displayed by many themes.'=>'大多数的主题在每个页面的顶端、浏览器标题栏、feed中显示站点标题。许多主题也显示副标题。','The fields on this screen determine some of the basics of your site setup.'=>'本页面中的选项决定您站点的基本配置。','timezone date formatY-m-d H:i:s'=>'Y-m-d H:i:s','General Settings'=>'常规选项','Retro (Generated)'=>'复古（自动生成）','MonsterID (Generated)'=>'小怪物（自动生成）','Wavatar (Generated)'=>'Wavatar（自动生成）','Identicon (Generated)'=>'抽象图形（自动生成）','Gravatar Logo'=>'Gravatar标志','Blank'=>'空白','Mystery Person'=>'神秘人士','For users without a custom avatar of their own, you can either display a generic logo or a generated one based on their email address.'=>'如用户没有自定义头像，您可以显示一个通用标志或用他们的电子邮件地址生成一个。','Default Avatar'=>'默认头像','X &#8212; Even more mature than above'=>'X —— 最高等级，不适合大多数人查看','R &#8212; Intended for adult audiences above 17'=>'R —— 成人级，只适合17岁以上成人查看','PG &#8212; Possibly offensive, usually for audiences 13 and above'=>'PG —— 可能有争议的头像，只适合13岁以上读者查看','G &#8212; Suitable for all audiences'=>'G —— 适合任何年龄的访客查看','Maximum Rating'=>'最高评级','Show Avatars'=>'显示头像','Avatar Display'=>'头像显示','An avatar is an image that follows you from weblog to weblog appearing beside your name when you comment on avatar enabled sites. Here you can enable the display of avatars for people who comment on your site.'=>'头像是您在各个博客见通用的图像。在每个启用了头像功能的站点上，它将显示在您的名字旁边。在这里您可以启用您站点上的读者评论头像显示功能。','Avatars'=>'头像','When a comment contains any of these words in its content, name, URL, email, or IP, it will be put in the trash. One word or IP per line. It will match inside words, so &#8220;press&#8221; will match &#8220;WordPress&#8221;.'=>'当评论的内容、姓名、URL、电邮或IP中包含以下文字，它将被移入回收站。每行输入一个词或IP地址。它也会在单词内部进行比对，所以“press”将会匹配“WordPress”。','Comment Blacklist'=>'评论黑名单','When a comment contains any of these words in its content, name, URL, email, or IP, it will be held in the <a href="edit-comments.php?comment_status=moderated">moderation queue</a>. One word or IP per line. It will match inside words, so &#8220;press&#8221; will match &#8220;WordPress&#8221;.'=>'当评论的内容、姓名、URL、电邮或IP中包含以下文字，它将被设定为<a href="edit-comments.php?comment_status=moderated">待审核</a>。每行输入一个词或IP地址。它也会在单词内部进行比对，所以“press”将会匹配“WordPress”。','Hold a comment in the queue if it contains %s or more links. (A common characteristic of comment spam is a large number of hyperlinks.)'=>'当某条评论包含超过%s个超链接时，将其放入等待审队列。（垃圾评论通常含有许多超链接。）','Comment Moderation'=>'评论审核','Comment author must have a previously approved comment'=>'评论者先前须有评论通过了审核','Comment must be manually approved'=>'评论必须经人工批准','Before a comment appears'=>'在评论显示之前','A comment is held for moderation'=>'有评论等待审核时','Anyone posts a comment'=>'有人发表评论时','Email me whenever'=>'发送电子邮件通知我','Comments should be displayed with the %s comments at the top of each page'=>'在每个页面顶部显示%s评论','newer'=>'新的','older'=>'旧的','Break comments into pages with %1$s top level comments per page and the %2$s page displayed by default'=>'分页显示评论，每页显示%1$s条评论，默认显示%2$s一页','first'=>'最前','last'=>'最后','Enable threaded (nested) comments %s levels deep'=>'启用评论嵌套，最多嵌套%s层','Automatically close comments on articles older than %s days'=>'自动关闭发布%s天后的文章上的评论功能','(Signup has been disabled. Only members of this site can comment.)'=>'（已禁止注册新用户。只有该站点的成员可以进行评论。）','Users must be registered and logged in to comment'=>'用户必须注册并登录才可以发表评论','Comment author must fill out name and email'=>'评论作者必须填入姓名和电子邮件地址','Other comment settings'=>'其他评论设置','These settings may be overridden for individual articles.'=>'这些设置可被具体的文章设置所覆盖。','Attempt to notify any blogs linked to from the article'=>'尝试通知文章中链接的博客','Default article settings'=>'默认文章设置','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Discussion_Screen">Documentation on Discussion Settings</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Settings_Discussion_Screen">讨论设置文档</a>','You must click the Save Changes button at the bottom of the screen for new settings to take effect.'=>'调整完成后，记得点击页面下方“保存更改”按钮使设置生效。','This screen provides many options for controlling the management and display of comments and links to your posts/pages. So many, in fact, they won&#8217;t all fit here! :) Use the documentation links to get information on what each discussion setting does.'=>'本页面包含对您文章或页面的评论、引用通告的显示选项。这么多，但实际上他们不是都适合呆在这儿的！访问文档链接以了解每个选项的作用。','Sorry, you are not allowed to manage options for this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能管理此站点的选项。','menu location(Currently set to: %s)'=>'（当前设置为：%s）','Display location'=>'显示位置','Auto add pages'=>'自动添加页面','Menu Settings'=>'菜单设置','Give your menu a name, then click Create Menu.'=>'给菜单命名，然后点击“创建菜单”。','Drag each item into the order you prefer. Click the arrow on the right of the item to reveal additional configuration options.'=>'拖放各个项目到您喜欢的顺序，点击右侧的箭头可进行更详细的设置。','Edit your default menu by adding or removing items. Drag each item into the order you prefer. Click Create Menu to save your changes.'=>'您可以通过加入或删除项目来编辑默认菜单，并将项目拖动到您喜欢的顺序。点击“创建菜单”按钮保存您的修改。','Menu Structure'=>'菜单结构','Save Menu'=>'保存菜单','or <a href="%s">create a new menu</a>.'=>'或<a href="%s">创建新菜单</a>。','Select a menu to edit:'=>'选择要编辑的菜单：','Edit your menu below, or <a href="%s">create a new menu</a>.'=>'在下方编辑您的菜单，或<a href="%s">创建新菜单</a>。','menuUse new menu'=>'使用新菜单','menuEdit'=>'编辑','Select a Menu'=>'选择菜单','Assigned Menu'=>'已指派的菜单','Theme Location'=>'主题位置','Manage Locations'=>'管理位置','Edit Menus'=>'编辑菜单','Manage with Live Preview'=>'使用实时预览管理','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Appearance_Menus_Screen">Documentation on Menus</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Appearance_Menus_Screen">菜单文档</a>','To add a new menu instead of assigning an existing one, <strong>click the &#8217;Use new menu&#8217; link</strong>. Your new menu will be automatically assigned to that theme location'=>'要添加菜单而不是指派已存在的菜单，<strong>点击“使用新菜单”链接</strong>。您的新菜单会被自动指派到相应的主题位置','To edit a menu currently assigned to a theme location, <strong>click the adjacent &#8217;Edit&#8217; link</strong>'=>'要编辑已被指派到主题位置的菜单，<strong>点击相应的“编辑”链接</strong>','To assign menus to one or more theme locations, <strong>select a menu from each location&#8217;s drop down.</strong> When you&#8217;re finished, <strong>click Save Changes</strong>'=>'要将菜单指派到主题位置，<strong>在每个位置的下拉菜单中选择菜单</strong>。当您完成后，<strong>点击“保存修改”</strong>','This screen is used for globally assigning menus to locations defined by your theme.'=>'在本页面调整主题中菜单的位置。','Editing Menus'=>'编辑菜单','Delete a menu item by <strong>expanding it and clicking the Remove link</strong>'=>'要删除菜单项目，请<strong>将其展开并点击“删除”链接</strong>','To reorganize menu items, <strong>drag and drop items with your mouse or use your keyboard</strong>. Drag or move a menu item a little to the right to make it a submenu'=>'要重排菜单项目，请<strong>用鼠标或键盘拖动项目</strong>。将项目稍稍拖到右侧可将其变为子菜单','To add a custom link, <strong>expand the Custom Links section, enter a URL and link text, and click Add to Menu</strong>'=>'要添加自定义链接，<strong>展开自定义链接小节，输入URL和链接文本，然后点击添加到菜单</strong>','Add one or several items at once by <strong>selecting the checkbox next to each item and clicking Add to Menu</strong>'=>'要添加一个或多个项目，请<strong>选择每个项目前的复选框，并点击“添加到菜单”</strong>','<strong>Clicking the arrow to the right of any menu item</strong> in the editor will reveal a standard group of settings. Additional settings such as link target, CSS classes, link relationships, and link descriptions can be enabled and disabled via the Screen Options tab.'=>'在编辑器中<strong>点击任一菜单项目标题右侧的箭头</strong>会显示一组标准设置。附加设置（如链接目标、CSS类、链接关系和链接描述等）可在“显示选项”页中设置显示或隐藏。','Each custom menu may contain a mix of links to pages, categories, custom URLs or other content types. Menu links are added by selecting items from the expanding boxes in the left-hand column below.'=>'每个自定义菜单都可包含页面、链接、自定义URL或其他内容类型。在下方左栏中展开的框中选择项目可添加菜单链接。','Menu Management'=>'菜单管理','You can assign theme locations to individual menus by <strong>selecting the desired settings</strong> at the bottom of the menu editor. To assign menus to all theme locations at once, <strong>visit the Manage Locations tab</strong> at the top of the screen.'=>'要指派单独菜单的主题位置，您可在菜单编辑器的底部<strong>选择想要的设置</strong>。要指派菜单到所有主题位置，请在顶部<strong>访问“管理位置”页</strong>。','If you haven&#8217;t yet created any menus, <strong>click the &#8217;create a new menu&#8217; link</strong> to get started'=>'如果您还没有创建任何菜单，请<strong>点击“创建新菜单”链接</strong>来开始','To edit an existing menu, <strong>choose a menu from the drop down and click Select</strong>'=>'要编辑已存在的菜单，<strong>在下拉菜单中选择菜单并点击“选择”</strong>','The menu management box at the top of the screen is used to control which menu is opened in the editor below.'=>'顶部的菜单管理框可用来控制在下方编辑器中打开哪个菜单。','Add, organize, and modify individual menu items'=>'添加、管理和修改某一菜单项','Create, edit, and delete menus'=>'创建、编辑和删除菜单','From this screen you can:'=>'在此界面中您可：','Menus can be displayed in locations defined by your theme, even used in sidebars by adding a &#8220;Custom Menu&#8221; widget on the <a href="%1$s">Widgets</a> screen. If your theme does not support the custom menus feature (the default themes, %2$s and %3$s, do), you can learn about adding this support by following the Documentation link to the side.'=>'菜单可在您的主题指定的位置显示，或通过<a href="%1$s">小工具</a>中的“自定义菜单”小工具显示在侧栏中。如果您的主题不支持自定义菜单功能（默认主题%2$s和%3$s均支持），您可以查阅侧面的文档链接了解如何加入这一支持。','This screen is used for managing your custom navigation menus.'=>'此页可用于管理您的自定导航菜单。','Your theme does not natively support menus, but you can use them in sidebars by adding a &#8220;Custom Menu&#8221; widget on the <a href="%s">Widgets</a> screen.'=>'当前的主题未提供原生的自定义菜单支持，您可以通过在<a href="%s">小工具</a>添加“自定义菜单”小工具来在侧栏上显示。','Menu locations updated.'=>'菜单位置已更新。','Please enter a valid menu name.'=>'请输入有效的菜单名称。','Selected menus have been successfully deleted.'=>'菜单已被成功删除。','The menu has been successfully deleted.'=>'菜单已被成功删除。','The menu item has been successfully deleted.'=>'菜单项已被成功删除。','Your theme does not support navigation menus or widgets.'=>'您的主题不支持导航菜单或小工具。','Visit'=>'访问','Global Settings'=>'全局设置','You must be a member of at least one site to use this page.'=>'您需要先成为至少一个站点的成员才能使用本页面。','siteAdd New'=>'添加新站点','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Dashboard_My_Sites_Screen">Documentation on My Sites</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Dashboard_My_Sites_Screen">我的站点文档</a>','This screen shows an individual user all of their sites in this network, and also allows that user to set a primary site. They can use the links under each site to visit either the front end or the dashboard for that site.'=>'本页面向用户展示他们在本站点网络中拥有的全部站点。用户可以设置一个主站点。用户可以使用站点名称下方的链接来访问站点的前、后台（“仪表盘”）。','The primary site you chose does not exist.'=>'您选择的主站点不存在。','Delete My Site Permanently'=>'永久删除我的站点','I\'m sure I want to permanently disable my site, and I am aware I can never get it back or use %s again.'=>'我确定要永久删除我的站点，并且我了解我不能再将其恢复，同时我知晓我今后也将无法再使用%s了。','Remember, once deleted your site cannot be restored.'=>'请注意，删除后数据不可恢复。','If you do not want to use your %s site any more, you can delete it using the form below. When you click <strong>Delete My Site Permanently</strong> you will be sent an email with a link in it. Click on this link to delete your site.'=>'如果您不想再使用%s站点了，您可以通过下面的表单来删除它。当您点击<strong>“永久删除我的站点”</strong>之后，我们将发送一封确认邮件。请点击确认邮件中的链接来删除您的站点。','Thank you. Please check your email for a link to confirm your action. Your site will not be deleted until this link is clicked.'=>'谢谢。请查阅您的电子邮件来获得链接以确认此操作。您的站点在该链接被点击后才会被删除。','Delete My Site'=>'删除我的站点','Howdy ###USERNAME###,

You recently clicked the \'Delete Site\' link on your site and filled in a
form on that page.

If you really want to delete your site, click the link below. You will not
be asked to confirm again so only click this link if you are absolutely certain:
###URL_DELETE###

If you delete your site, please consider opening a new site here
some time in the future! (But remember your current site and username
are gone forever.)

Thanks for using the site,
Webmaster
###SITE_NAME###'=>'嘿###USERNAME###：

您最近点击了“删除站点”链接，并完成了相关表单。

如果您确实要删除您的站点，请点击以下链接。
我们将不会再次让您确认，所以请只在十分确认后再点击：
###URL_DELETE###

如果您删除了您的站点，请仍然考虑在未来的时间于此建立新站点！
（但请注意，您现在的站点和用户名已经一去不返了。）
感谢您使用本站点，
站长
###SITE_NAME###','I\'m sorry, the link you clicked is stale. Please select another option.'=>'抱歉，链接已失效。请重试。','Thank you for using %s, your site has been deleted. Happy trails to you until we meet again.'=>'多谢使用%s，您的站点已被删除。祝您生活愉快。后会有期。','Sorry, you are not allowed to delete this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能删除此站点。','Multisite support is not enabled.'=>'未启用多站点支持。','Permalinks'=>'固定链接','Reading'=>'阅读','Writing'=>'撰写','settings screenGeneral'=>'常规','Network Setup'=>'配置网络','Delete Site'=>'删除站点','Available Tools'=>'可用工具','Tools'=>'工具','Add New User'=>'添加用户','Your Profile'=>'我的个人资料','userAdd New'=>'添加用户','All Users'=>'所有用户','Profile'=>'个人资料','plugin editorEditor'=>'编辑','pluginAdd New'=>'安装插件','Installed Plugins'=>'已安装的插件','Plugins %s'=>'插件%s','theme editorEditor'=>'编辑','Appearance'=>'外观','All Comments'=>'所有评论','Comments %s'=>'评论%s','admin menuAll Links'=>'全部链接','Library'=>'媒体库','Updates %s'=>'更新%s','Skip to main content'=>'跳至主内容','Main menu'=>'主页','Collapse menu'=>'收起菜单','Update Media'=>'更新媒体','fileAdd New'=>'添加新文件','This screen allows you to edit five fields for metadata in a file within the media library.'=>'在此页面，您可编辑媒体库中文件的5项属性。','You can&#8217;t edit this attachment because it is in the Trash. Please move it out of the Trash and try again.'=>'您无法编辑该附件，因为它当前在回收站中。请将其移出回收站，然后重试。','You attempted to edit an item that isn&#8217;t an attachment. Please go back and try again.'=>'您试图编辑的项目不是附件，请返回重试。','You attempted to edit an attachment that doesn&#8217;t exist. Perhaps it was deleted?'=>'您正在试图编辑一个不存在的附件。该文件可能已被删除？','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this attachment.'=>'抱歉，您不能编辑此附件。','Invalid item ID.'=>'无效项目ID。','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Media_Add_New_Screen">Documentation on Uploading Media Files</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Media_Add_New_Screen">上传媒体文件文档</a>','Revert to the <strong>Browser Uploader</strong> by clicking the link below the drag and drop box.'=>'点击拖拽框下方的链接可恢复使用<strong>浏览器上传工具</strong>。','Clicking <strong>Select Files</strong> opens a navigation window showing you files in your operating system. Selecting <strong>Open</strong> after clicking on the file you want activates a progress bar on the uploader screen.'=>'点击<strong>选择文件</strong>后将弹出您操作系统的“选择文件…”窗口。选择您需要上传的文件，单击<strong>打开</strong>，文件开始上传。进度条会自动出现，指示上传状态。','<strong>Drag and drop</strong> your files into the area below. Multiple files are allowed.'=>'将文件<strong>拖放到下方的区域</strong>。可以拖放多个文件。','You can upload media files here without creating a post first. This allows you to upload files to use with posts and pages later and/or to get a web link for a particular file that you can share. There are three options for uploading files:'=>'您可以不创建文章，直接上传多媒体文件。这样，您就可以得到一个用于分享的网络链接，当然，也可以在日后将这写媒体文件用在文章中。有如下三种上传文件的选择：','Upload New Media'=>'上传新媒体文件','Repair and Optimize Database'=>'修复并优化数据库','WordPress can also attempt to optimize the database. This improves performance in some situations. Repairing and optimizing the database can take a long time and the database will be locked while optimizing.'=>'WordPress还可以尝试优化数据库，这在某些情况下能提高数据库性能。修复和优化数据库的过程需要一段时间，请耐心等待——在此期间我们会锁定（lock）数据表。','Repair Database'=>'修复数据库','WordPress can automatically look for some common database problems and repair them. Repairing can take a while, so please be patient.'=>'WordPress能自动检测并修复一些常见数据库问题。修复过程需要一段时间，请耐心等待。','One or more database tables are unavailable. To allow WordPress to attempt to repair these tables, press the &#8220;Repair Database&#8221; button. Repairing can take a while, so please be patient.'=>'有些数据表无效。若您希望让WordPress尝试修复它们，请点击“修复数据库”按钮。修复过程需要一点时间，请耐心等待。','WordPress database repair'=>'WordPress数据库修复','Repairs complete. Please remove the following line from wp-config.php to prevent this page from being used by unauthorized users.'=>'修复完成。请移除刚刚在wp-config.php中添加的那行代码，以防他人滥用本页面。','https://wordpress.org/support/forum/how-to-and-troubleshooting'=>'https://cn.wordpress.org/support/forum/issues/','Some database problems could not be repaired. Please copy-and-paste the following list of errors to the <a href="%s">WordPress support forums</a> to get additional assistance.'=>'部分数据库问题无法修复。请复制下列错误信息，前往<a href="%s">WordPress支持论坛</a>寻求帮助。','Failed to optimize the %1$s table. Error: %2$s'=>'无法优化%1$s表。错误消息：%2$s','Successfully optimized the %s table.'=>'成功优化%s数据表。','The %s table is already optimized.'=>'%s数据表已优化过了。','Failed to repair the %1$s table. Error: %2$s'=>'无法修复%1$s表。错误消息：%2$s','Successfully repaired the %s table.'=>'成功修复了%s数据表。','The %1$s table is not okay. It is reporting the following error: %2$s. WordPress will attempt to repair this table&hellip;'=>'“%1$s”数据表有问题。报告的问题是：%2$s。WordPress正在尝试进行修复&hellip;','The %s table is okay.'=>'%s数据表正常。','Database repair results'=>'数据库修复结果','While you are editing your %1$s file, take a moment to make sure you have all 8 keys and that they are unique. You can generate these using the <a href="%2$s">WordPress.org secret key service</a>.'=>'当您在编辑您的%1$s文件时，请花点时间确认您有全部8个密钥，并且他们是独一无二的。您可以用<a href="%2$s">WordPress.org密钥服务</a>来生成它们。','Check secret keys'=>'检查密钥','To allow use of this page to automatically repair database problems, please add the following line to your %s file. Once this line is added to your config, reload this page.'=>'要允许本页面自动修复数据库问题，请将下面一行加入您的%s文件。完成后请刷新本页面。','Allow automatic database repair'=>'允许自动数据库修复','WordPress &rsaquo; Database Repair'=>'WordPress &rsaquo; 数据库修复','Link not found.'=>'未找到链接。','Edit Link'=>'编辑链接','Search Links'=>'搜索链接','%s link deleted.'=>'已删除%s个链接。','Links list'=>'链接列表','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Links_Screen">Documentation on Managing Links</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Links_Screen">管理链接文档</a>','If you delete a link, it will be removed permanently, as Links do not have a Trash function yet.'=>'若您删除一个链接，它将被永久移除。目前，链接不具备回收站功能。','Deleting Links'=>'链接的删除','You can customize the display of this screen using the Screen Options tab and/or the dropdown filters above the links table.'=>'您可以通过“显示选项”或链接列表上方的下拉菜单过滤器来自定义本页面的显示。','Links may be separated into Link Categories; these are different than the categories used on your posts.'=>'可以使用“链接分类目录”来组织链接。链接分类目录和文章分类目录不太相同。','You can add links here to be displayed on your site, usually using <a href="%s">Widgets</a>. By default, links to several sites in the WordPress community are included as examples.'=>'您可以在这里添加在您站点中显示的链接（通常在<a href="%s">小工具</a>中显示）。我们预置了几个链接至WordPress社区的链接作为例子。','Add New Link'=>'添加链接','Sorry, you are not allowed to add links to this site.'=>'抱歉，您不能添加链接到此站点。','WordPress has been installed. Thank you, and enjoy!'=>'WordPress安装完成。谢谢！','Success!'=>'成功！','Sorry, that isn&#8217;t a valid email address. Email addresses look like <code>username@example.com</code>.'=>'抱歉，电子邮件地址无效。形如<code>username@example.com</code>的才是电子邮件地址。','You must provide an email address.'=>'您必须提供电子邮件地址。','Your passwords do not match. Please try again.'=>'您两次输入的密码不符，请重试。','The username you provided has invalid characters.'=>'您提供的用户名包含非法字符。','Please provide a valid username.'=>'请提供有效的用户名。','Please provide the following information. Don&#8217;t worry, you can always change these settings later.'=>'您需要填写一些基本信息。无需担心填错，这些信息以后可以再次修改。','Information needed'=>'需要信息','Welcome to the famous five-minute WordPress installation process! Just fill in the information below and you&#8217;ll be on your way to using the most extendable and powerful personal publishing platform in the world.'=>'欢迎使用著名的WordPress五分钟安装程序！请简单地填写下面的表格，来开始使用这个世界上最具扩展性、最强大的个人信息发布平台。','The constant %s cannot be defined when installing WordPress.'=>'常量%s不能在安装WordPress时被定义。','Your %s file has an empty database table prefix, which is not supported.'=>'您的%s文件有一个空的数据库表前缀，这不被支持。','Configuration Error'=>'配置有误','Insufficient Requirements'=>'不满足条件','You cannot install because <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a> requires MySQL version %2$s or higher. You are running version %3$s.'=>'您不能安装，因为<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a>要求MySQL版本%2$s或更高。您正在运行版本%3$s。','You cannot install because <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a> requires PHP version %2$s or higher. You are running version %3$s.'=>'您不能安装，因为<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a>要求PHP版本%2$s或更高。您正在运行版本%3$s。','You cannot install because <a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a> requires PHP version %2$s or higher and MySQL version %3$s or higher. You are running PHP version %4$s and MySQL version %5$s.'=>'您不能安装，因为<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_%1$s">WordPress %1$s</a>要求PHP版本%2$s或更高、与MySQL版本%3$s或更高。您正在运行PHP版本%4$s和MySQL版本%5$s。','Install WordPress'=>'安装WordPress','It is up to search engines to honor this request.'=>'搜索引擎将本着自觉自愿的原则对待WordPress提出的请求。并不是所有搜索引擎都会遵守这类请求。','Note: Neither of these options blocks access to your site &mdash; it is up to search engines to honor your request.'=>'注意：这些设置并不能彻底防止搜索引擎访问您的站点——具体行为还取决于它们是否遵循您的要求。','Discourage search engines from indexing this site'=>'建议搜索引擎不索引本站点','Allow search engines to index this site'=>'允许搜索引擎索引本站点','Search Engine Visibility'=>'对搜索引擎的可见性','Site Visibility'=>'站点可见性','Double-check your email address before continuing.'=>'请仔细检查电子邮件地址后再继续。','Your Email'=>'您的电子邮件','Confirm Password'=>'确认密码','(required)'=>'（必填）','Repeat Password'=>'重复密码','You will need this password to log&nbsp;in. Please store it in a secure location.'=>'您将需要此密码来登录，请将其保存在安全的位置。','Important:'=>'重要：','Usernames can have only alphanumeric characters, spaces, underscores, hyphens, periods, and the @ symbol.'=>'用户名只能含有字母、数字、空格、下划线、连字符、句号和“@”符号。','User(s) already exists.'=>'用户已存在。','HowdyWelcome'=>'欢迎','WordPress &rsaquo; Installation'=>'WordPress &rsaquo; 安装','Dismiss the welcome panel'=>'关闭欢迎面板','<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Dashboard_Screen">Documentation on Dashboard</a>'=>'<a href="https://codex.wordpress.org/Dashboard_Screen">仪表盘文档</a>','<strong>Welcome</strong> &mdash; Shows links for some of the most common tasks when setting up a new site.'=>'<strong>欢迎</strong>——显示配置新站点的实用功能。','<strong>WordPress News</strong> &mdash; Latest news from the official WordPress project and the <a href="%s">WordPress Planet</a>.'=>'<strong>WordPress新闻</strong> — 来自WordPress项目的最新消息、<a href="%s">WordPress Planet</a>。','<strong>WordPress News</strong> &mdash; Latest news from the official WordPress project, the <a href="%s">WordPress Planet</a>, and popular plugins.'=>'<strong>WordPress新闻</strong> — 来自WordPress项目的最新消息、<a href="%s">WordPress Planet</a>和热门与最新的插件。','<strong>Quick Draft</strong> &mdash; Allows you to create a new post and save it as a draft. Also displays links to the 5 most recent draft posts you\'ve started.'=>'<strong>快速草稿</strong> — 让您创建新文章并保存为草稿，并显示5个指向最近草稿的链接。','<strong>Activity</strong> &mdash; Shows the upcoming scheduled posts, recently published posts, and the most recent comments on your posts and allows you to moderate them.'=>'<strong>动态</strong>——显示即将发布和最近发布的文章，近期的若干条评论，并进行审核。','<strong>At A Glance</strong> &mdash; Displays a summary of the content on your site and identifies which theme and version of WordPress you are using.'=>'<strong>概况</strong> — 显示您站点上的内容概况，以及主题与WordPress程序的版本信息。','The boxes on your Dashboard screen are:'=>'仪表盘中的模块有：','<strong>Box Controls</strong> &mdash; Click the title bar of the box to expand or collapse it. Some boxes added by plugins may have configurable content, and will show a &#8220;Configure&#8221; link in the title bar if you hover over it.'=>'<strong>管理模块</strong>——点击模块的标题栏即可展开或收起它。另外，有些模块提供额外的配置选项，在您将鼠标移动到这些模块的标题栏上方时，会出现“配置”链接。','<strong>Drag and Drop</strong> &mdash; To rearrange the boxes, drag and drop by clicking on the title bar of the selected box and releasing when you see a gray dotted-line rectangle appear in the location you want to place the box.'=>'<strong>拖放自如</strong>——要重新排列模块，按住模块的标题栏，将其拖动到您希望的位置，在灰色虚线框出现后松开鼠标，即可调整模块的位置。','<strong>Screen Options</strong> &mdash; Use the Screen Options tab to choose which Dashboard boxes to show.'=>'<strong>显示选项</strong>——使用“显示选项”选项卡来选择要显示的仪表模块。','You can use the following controls to arrange your Dashboard screen to suit your workflow. This is true on most other administration screens as well.'=>'您可以依您的喜好和工作方式来安排仪表盘页面的布局。大部分其它管理页面也支持重新排列功能。','Navigation'=>'导航','Links in the Toolbar at the top of the screen connect your dashboard and the front end of your site, and provide access to your profile and helpful WordPress information.'=>'上方“工具栏”上的链接将仪表盘和站点前台连接起来，默认在站点的所有页面显示，提供您的个人资料信息以及相关的WordPress信息。','The left-hand navigation menu provides links to all of the WordPress administration screens, with submenu items displayed on hover. You can minimize this menu to a narrow icon strip by clicking on the Collapse Menu arrow at the bottom.'=>'左侧的导航菜单提供了所有WordPress管理页面的链接。将鼠标移至菜单项目上，子菜单将显示出来。您可以使用最下方的“收起菜单”箭头来收起菜单，菜单项将以小图标的形式显示。','Welcome to your WordPress Dashboard! This is the screen you will see when you log in to your site, and gives you access to all the site management features of WordPress. You can get help for any screen by clicking the Help tab above the screen title.'=>'欢迎访问WordPress仪表盘！在您每次登录站点后，您都会看到本页面。您可以在这里访问WordPress的各种管理页面。点击任何页面标题上方的“帮助”选项卡可阅读相应帮助信息。','widgetAdd'=>'添加','widgetEdit'=>'编辑','Edit widget: %s'=>'编辑小工具：%s','Hi,
