谢谢！——WordPress团队','FAILED: %s'=>'失败：%s','The following translations failed to update:'=>'以下翻译未能升级：','The following themes failed to update:'=>'以下主题未能升级：','The following plugins failed to update:'=>'以下插件未能升级：','SUCCESS: %s'=>'成功：%s','The following translations were successfully updated:'=>'以下翻译已成功升级：','The following themes were successfully updated:'=>'以下主题已成功升级：','The following plugins were successfully updated:'=>'以下插件已成功升级：','FAILED: WordPress failed to update to %s'=>'失败：WordPress未能升级至%s','SUCCESS: WordPress was successfully updated to %s'=>'成功：WordPress已成功升级至%s','WordPress site: %s'=>'WordPress站点：%s','Error code: %s'=>'错误代码：%s','Your hosting company, support forum volunteers, or a friendly developer may be able to use this information to help you:'=>'您的主机商、支持论坛的志愿者、或一位友善的开发者将可以利用以下信息来帮您：','We have some data that describes the error your site encountered.'=>'我们有一些关于您的站点遇到的错误的信息。','Your site was running version %s.'=>'您的站点正在运行%s版本。','The WordPress Team'=>'WordPress团队','You also have some plugins or themes with updates available. Update them now:'=>'您的一些插件或主题也有更新可用，请更新它们：','If you reach out to us, we\'ll also ensure you\'ll never have this problem again.'=>'如果您联系我们，我们也将尽力确保您不再遇到此问题。','Keeping your site updated is important for security. It also makes the internet a safer place for you and your readers.'=>'保持更新站点对确保安全至关重要，这也会让互联网和您的读者更安全。','If you experience any issues or need support, the volunteers in the WordPress.org support forums may be able to help.'=>'如果您遇到了任何问题或需要帮助，WordPress.org支持论坛的志愿者或许能帮到您。','The WordPress team is willing to help you. Forward this email to %s and the team will work with you to make sure your site is working.'=>'WordPress团队愿意帮您。转发此电子邮件到%s，我们的团队将协助您保持站点正常工作。','Please check out your site now. It\'s possible that everything is working. If it says you need to update, you should do so:'=>'请检查您的站点，有可能一切工作正常。如果它说您需要更新，请照做：','This means your site may be offline or broken. Don\'t panic; this can be fixed.'=>'这意味着您的站点可能已不可用或损坏。别慌，这能被修好。','Your site at %1$s experienced a critical failure while trying to update to the latest version of WordPress, %2$s.'=>'您位于 %1$s 的站点在更新至WordPress的最新版本，%2$s的过程中遇到了严重问题。','Your site at %1$s experienced a critical failure while trying to update WordPress to version %2$s.'=>'您位于 %1$s 的站点在更新至到WordPress %2$s的过程中遇到了严重问题。','We tried but were unable to update your site automatically.'=>'我们未能自动更新您的站点。','Please update your site at %1$s to WordPress %2$s.'=>'请升级您位于 %1$s 的站点到WordPress %2$s。','Updating is easy and only takes a few moments:'=>'升级很简单，花不了您多长时间：','WordPress %s is also now available.'=>'WordPress %s也已可用。','For more on version %s, see the About WordPress screen:'=>'要获取更多关于%s版本的信息，请参阅“关于WordPress”页面：','No further action is needed on your part.'=>'您不需要再做什么。','Howdy! Your site at %1$s has been updated automatically to WordPress %2$s.'=>'您好！您的站点 %1$s 已被自动更新至WordPress %2$s。','[%1$s] URGENT: Your site may be down due to a failed update'=>'[%1$s] 紧急：因更新失败，您的站点或已不可用','[%1$s] WordPress %2$s is available. Please update!'=>'[%1$s] WordPress %2$s现已可用，请更新！','[%1$s] Your site has updated to WordPress %2$s'=>'[%1$s] 您的站点已被更新至WordPress %2$s','WordPress updated successfully'=>'WordPress升级成功','Installation Failed'=>'安装失败','Could not access filesystem.'=>'无法访问文件系统。','Translations for %s'=>'%s的翻译','Updating plugin: %s'=>'升级插件：%s','Updating theme: %s'=>'升级主题：%s','WordPress %s'=>'WordPress %s','Updating to WordPress %s'=>'更新至WordPress %s','To the top'=>'最顶','Down one'=>'下一位','Up one'=>'上一位','Move'=>'移动至','CSS Classes (optional)'=>'CSS类（可选）','Edit menu item'=>'编辑菜单项','sub item'=>'子项目','nav menu front page titleHome: %s'=>'首页：%s','The theme is missing the %s file.'=>'主题缺少%s文件。','The %s stylesheet doesn&#8217;t contain a valid theme header.'=>'%s样式表未包含合法的主题头部。','The theme is missing the %s stylesheet.'=>'主题缺少%s样式表。','<strong>The parent theme could not be found.</strong> You will need to install the parent theme, <strong>%s</strong>, before you can use this child theme.'=>'<strong>找不到父主题。</strong>您需要正确安装